		"_postman_id": "e-commerce-marketplace-api",
		"name": "E-Commerce Marketplace API",
		"description": "Complete API collection for the E-Commerce Marketplace.\n\n## API Call Order (Dependencies)\n\n### 1. Authentication (Start Here)\n1. Register OR Login\n2. All subsequent calls require the access token\n\n### 2. Browse (No Auth Required)\n- Get Categories\n- Get Products (with filters)\n- Get Product Details\n- Get Product Reviews\n\n### 3. Shopping Cart (Auth Required)\n1. Add items to cart\n2. View cart\n3. Apply coupon (optional)\n4. Validate cart\n\n### 4. Checkout (Auth Required)\n1. Get/Create addresses\n2. Create order (from cart)\n\n### 5. Order Management\n- View orders\n- Cancel order\n- Admin: Update status, refund\n\n## Test Credentials\n- **Admin**: admin@marketplace.com / Password123!\n- **Seller**: seller1@marketplace.com / Password123!\n- **Customer**: john.doe@email.com / Password123!\n\n## Auto Token Setup\nAfter login/register, the access token is automatically saved to the collection variable `{{accessToken}}`.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
